---
title: "Control Value"
---



Faster detection has value because (i) loss is recorded sooner, which improves information, and (ii) in this simulator an event's size grows with the time it stays undiscovered. This page measures how much a detection control is worth **under those assumptions**. The effect sizes and costs are placeholders, not benchmarks; a real engagement would replace them with measured detection times and quoted prices.

